# delayed_convolution_neuron.nestml
# ##################################
#
#
# Description
# +++++++++++
#
# Test models for convolutions with a delayed spike input port, ``convolve(K, spikes(t - d))``.
#
# ``delayed_convolution_neuron`` convolves the same alpha kernel once with the undelayed and once with the delayed spike train. Its
# reference, ``delayed_convolution_reference_neuron``, has only the undelayed convolution; driving it through two connections whose
# delays differ by ``kernel_delay`` (the second with twice the weight) should give the same membrane potential.
#
# The ``nonlinear`` pair does the same with an exponential kernel and a nonlinear membrane equation, so that the numeric solver is used.
#
#
# Copyright statement
# +++++++++++++++++++
